# RDF Unreleased Release Notes

## Unreleased

-- New Features --

[New] rdf account default <name>|-: store the account the rdf shell init launchers use when
      neither @name nor cuse picks one; list shows it, '-' clears it, and removing that
      account clears it

-- Bug Fixes --

[Fix] CI Plugin job failed on every push: newer Claude Code validators warn that CLAUDE.md
      at the plugin root is not loaded as project context (RDF's repo root is the plugin
      root), and --strict made that fatal; the step now reads the --json report and fails
      on any error or any other warning
